Committed (`c6eefb2f2`). Five files changed:

- **`AbstractRSSReader`** — gained `protected static reverseCounters(int[])`, making it available to all RSS reader subclasses
- **`RSS14Reader`** — 5-line inline swap replaced by `reverseCounters(counters)`
- **`RSSExpandedReader`** — private duplicate of `reverseCounters` removed (now inherited); call sites unchanged
- **`AlignmentPatternFinder`** — `Arrays.fill(stateCount, 0)` in both `find()` and `crossCheckVertical()`; added `java.util.Arrays` import
- **`HighLevelEncoder`** — anonymous `Comparator` replaced by lambda `(a, b) -> a.getBitCount() - b.getBitCount()`; unused `Comparator` import removed

